WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:03.418
Unit seventeen. Dogs and Rabies!

2
00:00:04.373 --> 00:00:07.988
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.038 --> 00:00:11.600
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.383
Today we learn about Dogs and Rabies. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.833
Dog. Say it with me. Dog!

6
00:00:23.326 --> 00:00:27.010
Rabies. Say it with me. Rabies!

7
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.504
Bite. Say it with me. Bite!

8
00:00:36.985 --> 00:00:40.269
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

9
00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.987
Soap. Say it with me. Soap!

10
00:00:50.472 --> 00:00:53.773
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

11
00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:00.707
Vaccine. Say it with me. Vaccine!

12
00:01:04.215 --> 00:01:07.431
Stray. Say it with me. Stray!

13
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:21.562
Some dogs can carry rabies, a very dangerous illness. I stay away from stray dogs. If a dog bites me, I wash the bite with soap and water and go to a doctor for a vaccine.

14
00:01:21.612 --> 00:01:22.882
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:29.302
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.352 --> 00:01:30.502
Bite!

17
00:01:31.292 --> 00:01:36.322
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.372 --> 00:01:37.522
Vaccine!

19
00:01:38.492 --> 00:01:44.568
Did you know? Rabies can be prevented if a person gets vaccines quickly after a bite!

20
00:01:44.618 --> 00:01:46.550
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.243 --> 00:01:54.694
Think and answer. What should you do after an animal bite?

22
00:01:54.744 --> 00:01:55.894
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.029 --> 00:02:01.801
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.851 --> 00:02:04.456
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

